#9063=/* Nested gzip recursion bomb (.stpz stack; cross-file-state):
   Wrapper structure (outermost first):
     Layer 8: gzip(Layer 7)  magic: 1F 8B  ratio ~1:100
     Layer 7: gzip(Layer 6)  magic: 1F 8B  ratio ~1:100
     Layer 6: gzip(Layer 5)  magic: 1F 8B  ratio ~1:100
